  "content": "\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/BN0CNhT/More-Hammers-and-Excavat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\"></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Добавляет в игру кувалды и экскаваторы и поддерживает множество модов!</strong></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span>&nbsp;</span></div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Поддерживаемые моды:</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragonloot\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dragon Loot</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderite Mod</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythic-upgrades\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Upgrades</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Благодарности:</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">CocoMania за текстуры для Mythic Metals!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;Нажмите на любую из ссылок ниже, чтобы посмотреть мои работы:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qyYwHykSmE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KrWjv8p/discord-rectangle-500x160.png\" alt=\"Присоединяйтесь к серверу Discord\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ianm1647/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vmx15sd/download.png\" alt=\"Мой GitHub\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
